    "created_at": "2026-03-25T23:05:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-25T23:05:13Z",
    "body": "Some more elaboration:\r\nThe general idea behind these changes is that there's two cases to consider:\r\n1. New document with a new navigable\r\n2. Navigable navigating around to a different document\r\n\r\nThe first one needs to initialize the visibility state after the navigable gets created, (cause that happens after the document is made active) whereas the second one can do it right after making the document active because the navigable already exists at that point.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
